<title>UK: World Bank sets 100 million rand five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 100 million rand five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.50     MATURITY    06.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
